1
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,319
Well, well.

2
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:43,439
Starting the party without me?

3
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,200
Mr. Bi.

4
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:47,120
She's here.

5
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,280
Ding Ning,

6
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,280
this is Mr. Bi.

7
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,280
Yijie tells me

8
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,959
you play the piano well.

9
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,640
Come on.

10
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:03,879
Mr. Bi,

11
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:05,560
her hand... it's...

12
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,560
Then

13
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,919
just show us.

14
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:14,879
Don't ruin the mood.

15
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,960
Guess you have to go.

16
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,080
Come on.

17
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,159
Yijie was absolutely right.

18
00:03:21,639 --> 00:03:22,680
You played beautifully.

19
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:25,159
Thank you, Mr. Bi.

20
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:37,919
I admire headstrong young people.

21
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,639
Mr. Bi,

22
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:44,280
Ding Ning prepared a special gift for you.

23
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:55,960
Ruqing,

24
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,080
I prepared a gift for you, too.

25
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:01,960
Have a seat.

26
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,199
Here.

27
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,400
Go check it thoroughly.

28
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,840
See if there are any backups.

29
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:16,360
Ding Ning, let me introduce myself.

30
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,879
Fuxia Group legal representative Li Sheng.

31
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,759
Next to me is Warden Zhao,

32
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,959
head of the First Detention Center.

33
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,720
And this is...

34
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,800
the Deputy Team Leader of the task force

35
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:30,480
So Zhao Yijie had someone inside our team.

36
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:33,360
Alright.

37
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:35,360
Come.

38
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,240
Here, pick one.

39
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,680
Huxley's

40
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,399
Brave New World.

41
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,160
I've read it.

42
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,839
I don't want comfort.

43
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,439
I want God,

44
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,759
I want poetry,

45
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:12,839
I want

46
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,279
real danger,

47
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,759
I know the rest of it.

48
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,600
I want...

49
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:18,560
Wait, hold on.

50
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,639
I want...

51
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:22,240
I want freedom, I want goodness.

52
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:23,639
I want sin.

53
00:05:24,879 --> 00:05:25,720
Impressive.

54
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,480
Good.

55
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,120
Not bad at all.

56
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,160
There is one more line.

57
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,120
In fact,

58
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,720
you're claiming

59
00:05:33,879 --> 00:05:35,720
the right to be unhappy.

60
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,160
You guys are impressive.

61
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,480
Ding Ning.

62
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,720
Never underestimate this postcard.

63
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,000
It means you are already

64
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,720
a member of our big family.

65
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,279
The postcard

66
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:47,279
also serves as a form of contact.

67
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,720
When you receive it,

68
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,720
it means

69
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,519
you are needed again.

70
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,800
Here, Ding Ning.

71
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,839
Keep your Brave New World safe.

72
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,079
I thought I had failed the test.

73
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:05,079
Don't underestimate others so easily,

74
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,720
and don't underestimate yourself.

75
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:09,759
We don't need blindly obedient tools.

76
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:12,079
I admire

77
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:13,920
young people with faith.

78
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,319
What do you think my faith is?

79
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,839
I think

80
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,959
it's power.

81
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,160
The power to dismantle authority.

82
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,000
The sharpest blade

83
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,160
is always hidden in the gentlest sheath.

84
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,560
It means you are cultivating yourself

85
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,079
to become a creator.

86
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,160
A creator?

87
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:37,920
Yes.

88
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:39,720
To create rules.

89
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,079
To create principles.

90
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,360
To create

91
00:06:42,959 --> 00:06:44,519
new standards of good and evil.

92
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,680
That is your true driving force.

93
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,519
Come.

94
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,000
Let's all

95
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,480
raise a glass to Ding Ning.

96
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,279
Welcome her.

97
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,639
Welcome, welcome!

98
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:55,240
Welcome, welcome!

99
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,439
Eat up.

100
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,360
Eat some more.

101
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,639
Mr. Bi,

102
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:11,160
actually, I came today

103
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,040
to ask for permission.

104
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,240
Go ahead.

105
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,720
I want to ask you

106
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,600
to let me take Lu Zhiyong home for a day,

107
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,279
to offer incense to his father.

108
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:28,480
It might not even take a whole day.

109
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,120
Even just a few hours would be fine.

110
00:07:31,639 --> 00:07:33,240
You know,

111
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,519
the boy who took the fall for Kevin.

112
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:39,160
His father passed away two weeks ago.

113
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:43,279
Such a major thing...

114
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:44,879
why didn't you tell me earlier?

115
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:45,519
Yes.

116
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:47,000
Look what a mess this is.

117
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:47,879
My fault.

118
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:48,839
I'm sorry.

119
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,439
Well then,

120
00:07:51,439 --> 00:07:51,920
Ding Ning.

121
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:52,959
You handle it.

122
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:54,759
Everyone at this table

123
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,399
is at your disposal.

124
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,319
Also,

125
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:10,839
on my behalf,

126
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,480
please comfort

127
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,959
Lu Zhiyong and his family,

128
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,199
will you?

129
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,560
Thank you, Mr. Bi.

130
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,279
Here,

131
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,600
have a meatball.

132
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:24,920
Eat it while it's hot.

133
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:31,399
Mr. Bi...

134
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:32,919
it's my fault I didn't follow up...

135
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,399
Sit down.

136
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:36,399
Don't move.

137
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,879
It won't taste good cold.

138
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:09,879
Eat this.

139
00:09:11,039 --> 00:09:11,559
Mr. Bi.

140
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:13,039
Did I say you could speak?

141
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,639
Don't you chew your food?

142
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,200
Delicious, right?

143
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:55,159
Only when it burns until there's just pain,

144
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,519
do you finally realize

145
00:09:58,919 --> 00:10:00,080
you shouldn't be a picky eater.

146
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
I'll tell you what.

147
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:06,080
One meatball equals one hour.

148
00:10:06,639 --> 00:10:07,480
However many you can eat,

149
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,039
Xiao Lu

150
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,639
gets that many hours

151
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,600
to offer incense to his father.

152
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,679
How about it?

153
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:29,679
Yijie,

154
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,879
you really have a good eye.

155
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,320
In the future, Ding Ning

156
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,360
will go further than any of us here.

157
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,960
No more complications with Lu's case.

158
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,240
Once it's done,

159
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,879
I'll officially introduce you

160
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,080
to everyone.

161
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,000
Do we have a deal?

162
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:56,559
Alright.

163
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,480
Let's keep eating.

164
00:10:58,399 --> 00:11:00,320
Mr. Bi, you're playing favorites.

165
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,200
We all really love the meatballs.

166
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,600
Here, come on.

167
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,440
Have some.

168
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,279
It's me.

169
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:58,879
As soon as I got the news,

170
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,120
I rushed over.

171
00:12:02,799 --> 00:12:04,159
I wanted to let you sleep a bit longer,

172
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,440
so I didn't wake you.

173
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,559
There's a multi-car crash ahead of you.

174
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,279
You'll probably have to wait a bit longer.

175
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,480
Your mouth must be full of blisters,

176
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:15,480
and sores.

177
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,840
Your esophagus must be burned too.

178
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,000
Here, spit into this.

179
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,879
It hurts to swallow.

180
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,600
I'm sorry.

181
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:31,960
I couldn't protect you.

182
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:39,679
The list.

183
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,679
Are you sure the people on the list

184
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:47,159
are all people you saw with your own eyes?

185
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:49,720
Let me introduce myself.

186
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:51,879
Fuxia Group legal representative Li Sheng.

187
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,960
About Liang Zidong,

188
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,240
thanks for your hard work.

189
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,519
Beside me is Warden Zhao,

190
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,519
head of the First Detention Center.

191
00:12:58,919 --> 00:12:59,639
Lawyer Ding.

192
00:13:00,279 --> 00:13:00,960
A pleasure to meet you.

193
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,159
These two need no introduction, I assume.

194
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,639
We often deal with them on our cases.

195
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,919
This is

196
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:09,000
the Deputy Team Leader investigating us,

197
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:10,840
who is also Ma Tingting's former boss.

198
00:13:11,159 --> 00:13:11,960
Ding Ning.

199
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:14,320
Thanks to your report on the fake base,

200
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,840
the investigation team was suspended.

201
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:18,080
It bought us time.

202
00:13:18,519 --> 00:13:19,200
For this,

203
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:19,879
I'd like to toast you.

204
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,360
Ding Ning,

205
00:13:21,399 --> 00:13:23,919
if Liang Zidong were half as smart as you,

206
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:25,039
none of this would have happened.

207
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:25,639
Come on,

208
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,279
let's have a drink together.

209
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:43,440
I haven't officially joined them yet.

210
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:45,000
It's highly likely that behind them...

211
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,480
are people you'd never even imagine.

212
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,120
Ding Ning, to be honest...

213
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:51,279
If the names on this list are all real...

214
00:13:51,559 --> 00:13:53,200
...then this goes way beyond...

215
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,600
...the scope of my team's investigation.

216
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:57,720
No.

217
00:13:58,039 --> 00:13:58,799
You need to pull out first.

218
00:13:58,799 --> 00:13:59,840
No matter what they want,

219
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:00,919
you're in the most danger right now.

220
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,679
Of course I believe you.

221
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:10,399
And it's a good thing I do.

222
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:11,879
But you have to understand...

223
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,039
After this mess with Xiao Lu is over,

224
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:15,840
it's highly likely that...

225
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,200
...you and Yu Songfan will take the fall.

226
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,360
And they'll walk away scot-free.

227
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,919
This could all just be a big show.

228
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,039
A show to trick you deeper into their trap.

229
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,759
They're very likely just...

230
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,200
...just...

231
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:31,559
...taking the bullet for people higher up.

232
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,360
We can treat the symptoms,

233
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:35,039
but we must cure the root cause.

234
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,879
It's getting late.

235
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:48,960
Time to go home.

236
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:51,000
No adults at your house lately, right?

237
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:53,240
Grandpa Yu hasn't visited in a long time.

238
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,279
I'm a bit worried. I want to check on him.

239
00:14:55,279 --> 00:14:56,039
I'm leaving now.

240
00:14:56,159 --> 00:14:58,039
Come hang out at my place next time.

241
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,840
I see you really like this game.

242
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,759
This is for you.

243
00:15:04,559 --> 00:15:05,399
Awu,

244
00:15:18,919 --> 00:15:20,320
Don't move.

245
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,279
Or I might cut your skin.

246
00:15:22,279 --> 00:15:23,200
Silly kid.

247
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,399
I miss Grandpa Yu.

248
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:29,840
You miss Grandpa Yu?

249
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,480
When Daddy is free,

250
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,080
I'll take you to see Grandpa Yu, okay?

251
00:15:33,399 --> 00:15:33,960
Okay.

252
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:37,639
But could you

253
00:15:37,639 --> 00:15:39,159
promise Daddy one thing first?

254
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,159
What is it?

255
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:42,759
That friend of yours named Kevin,

256
00:15:43,799 --> 00:15:45,360
can you hang out with him less?

257
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,799
That way, you'll have a lot more time

258
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:49,039
to visit Grandpa Yu.

259
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,639
I didn't ask him to play.

260
00:15:50,799 --> 00:15:52,639
He's usually the one who asks me.

261
00:15:52,919 --> 00:15:53,720
I know.

262
00:15:54,159 --> 00:15:55,879
So if he asks you again,

263
00:15:55,879 --> 00:15:56,960
tell Daddy first,

264
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:58,159
alright?

265
00:15:58,279 --> 00:15:59,039
Why?

266
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:01,240
I think he's pretty nice.

267
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,159
He is nice.

268
00:16:04,159 --> 00:16:06,200
But he's a grown-up, you see.

269
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,720
And you're still a kid.

270
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,039
Shouldn't kids

271
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:11,279
play with other kids?

272
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,240
Okay.

273
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:18,279
Such a good kid.

274
00:16:19,799 --> 00:16:21,639
Do we have to send Grandpa Yu

275
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,120
to the nursing home?

276
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:28,080
Let me ask you this.

277
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,879
Do you have to go to school?

278
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:33,440
Exactly.

279
00:16:33,679 --> 00:16:34,919
People of a certain age

280
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:36,600
should do things meant for their age.

281
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,120
Right?

282
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,360
Alright, all done.

283
00:16:44,039 --> 00:16:44,799
Goodnight.

284
00:17:04,799 --> 00:17:06,160
Coming, coming! I'm coming!

285
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:11,680
Hello.

286
00:17:12,119 --> 00:17:13,240
I'm Yang Jingyi.

287
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,200
Yang Cheng is my father.

288
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,880
I used to be

289
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,440
called Yang Miao.

290
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,200
Come on in.

291
00:17:23,279 --> 00:17:24,279
No need to take off your shoes.

292
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:24,599
It's fine like this.

293
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:25,160
Thank you.

294
00:17:36,359 --> 00:17:36,920
Have a seat.

295
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,359
Mr. Yu,

296
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,200
You're the one who accompanied my father

297
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:17,400
on his final journey.

298
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:18,880
Thank you.

299
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:20,640
Also,

300
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,279
regarding what my father did

301
00:18:22,519 --> 00:18:24,680
to your wife and child,

302
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,640
I apologize on his behalf.

303
00:18:27,319 --> 00:18:28,440
I'm truly sorry.

304
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:42,240
I came to collect my father's ashes

305
00:18:42,799 --> 00:18:43,359
and take them home.

306
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:47,440
His ashes aren't here.

307
00:18:47,839 --> 00:18:48,680
They're

308
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,880
with a friend of mine.

309
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:51,640
Then...

310
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:53,039
what about Awu?

311
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:54,799
Is Awu here?

312
00:18:55,119 --> 00:18:57,440
My cousin also told me over the phone...

313
00:18:57,559 --> 00:18:58,880
I had always thought

314
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,440
the baby died right after birth.

315
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,000
Mr. Yu.

316
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,880
I want to see Awu.

317
00:19:07,279 --> 00:19:07,920
Miss Yang,

318
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,680
I have to ask you...

319
00:19:11,319 --> 00:19:14,799
Are you here to take your father's ashes,

320
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,400
or are you here

321
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,480
to take Yang Awu away?

322
00:19:21,759 --> 00:19:22,519
First of all,

323
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:24,000
think about it.

324
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,839
Do you have the right to ask for this?

325
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,920
Did your cousin tell you

326
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,480
how he abused Yang Awu?

327
00:19:36,359 --> 00:19:38,480
How much he suffered at his house?

328
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,400
Do you have any idea?

329
00:19:40,519 --> 00:19:42,000
It took a lot for me

330
00:19:42,279 --> 00:19:43,240
to find him,

331
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,400
bring him back,

332
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,440
send him to school,

333
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:48,279
and give him a stable life.

334
00:19:50,559 --> 00:19:52,160
He's my own grandson.

335
00:19:54,119 --> 00:19:56,359
Don't think you can just snatch him away.

336
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,279
Your grandson?

337
00:19:59,759 --> 00:20:00,359
Yes.

338
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:03,759
Okay.

339
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,039
Mr. Yu, please...

340
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:06,640
Please don't get so worked up.

341
00:20:06,799 --> 00:20:08,599
I completely understand how you feel.

342
00:20:09,119 --> 00:20:10,400
Thank you for taking care of Awu.

343
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,079
Thank you.

344
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:13,359
But Awu has the right to know

345
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,200
that he has a mother.

346
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:19,119
He really isn't here.

347
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,519
Just look at you...

348
00:20:20,519 --> 00:20:21,839
I know. Just listen to me.

349
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,279
I'm not trying to take him away.

350
00:20:23,279 --> 00:20:24,480
Then why are you here?

351
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,200
How about this?

352
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,559
I'll come back

353
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:27,359
in a week.

354
00:20:28,559 --> 00:20:29,160
Is that okay?

355
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,599
I just want to see him once.

356
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,440
Let's touch base in a week, then, okay?

357
00:20:48,799 --> 00:20:49,599
Sorry.

358
00:20:49,599 --> 00:20:51,079
I... I'd better write it down.

359
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:51,680
I'm really

360
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:52,839
afraid you'll forget.

361
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,000
May 15th.

362
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,599
Yang Miao

363
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:03,960
came to see Awu.

364
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:11,680
I'll be back in a week.

365
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,000
Take care.

366
00:21:14,519 --> 00:21:15,039
Miss Yang,

367
00:21:19,279 --> 00:21:21,039
about my son

368
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,440
doing such a thing,

369
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:27,599
I'm very sorry.

370
00:21:28,519 --> 00:21:29,200
I really am.

371
00:21:31,279 --> 00:21:32,000
I'm sorry.

372
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:00,559
Some of my cellmates helped me look it up.

373
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:03,440
I can go out to offer incense to my dad.

374
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,920
I have a fever too.

375
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,200
And...

376
00:22:17,359 --> 00:22:18,960
who exactly are the "they" you mentioned?

377
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,480
I don't need a doctor.

378
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,599
The "they" you mentioned...

379
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,519
are you guys, right?

380
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,359
You deliberately stalled me

381
00:22:34,359 --> 00:22:36,279
so I couldn't see my dad one last time,

382
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:38,200
because you were afraid I'd recant.

383
00:22:50,279 --> 00:22:51,279
Six hours.

384
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:54,920
Six hours.

385
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:57,200
A few older guys in my cell

386
00:22:57,799 --> 00:22:59,079
are all in for telecom fraud.

387
00:23:00,519 --> 00:23:01,599
One of them

388
00:23:02,039 --> 00:23:03,240
is also from Lingchuan County.

389
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:05,000
He and Fang Quan, who I stabbed to death,

390
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,319
are from the same hometown.

391
00:23:08,039 --> 00:23:10,039
They have a local insult back there

392
00:23:11,279 --> 00:23:12,000
called "fool."

393
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,079
It just means an idiot.

394
00:23:15,359 --> 00:23:17,039
I think before Fang Quan died,

395
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,920
he was probably cursing me like that too.

396
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,079
So,

397
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,720
I don't want to be a fool.

398
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,279
I'm adding conditions.

399
00:23:31,839 --> 00:23:32,559
Lawyer Ding,

400
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:33,839
have some water and calm down.

401
00:23:34,119 --> 00:23:34,799
Everyone is just

402
00:23:35,119 --> 00:23:35,960
concerned about this kid.

403
00:23:36,279 --> 00:23:36,839
Thanks for your trouble.

404
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,440
The fact Fan Dong could barge in last time

405
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,279
was also specially approved by me.

406
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,119
I want the best burial plot for my dad.

407
00:23:43,599 --> 00:23:44,160
If you can't do it,

408
00:23:44,559 --> 00:23:46,680
I'll expose the whole truth.

409
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:48,480
I also want more money.

410
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:50,720
One million.

411
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,440
Put it in my mom's bankbook.

412
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,519
In three days,

413
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,400
I want to see her bring the money to me.

414
00:23:55,839 --> 00:23:57,240
Only then will I keep your secret.

415
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,079
Stop talking.

416
00:24:03,279 --> 00:24:04,559
You were the one who told me to speak,

417
00:24:05,450 --> 00:24:06,850
and now you're the one chickening out.

418
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,200
You adults are all the same.

419
00:24:16,359 --> 00:24:17,279
I'll come pick you up tomorrow.

420
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:18,839
I'm too ashamed to face my dad.

421
00:24:19,559 --> 00:24:20,839
You have three days.

422
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,440
If you can't do it,

423
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:26,480
I'll tell the whole truth.

424
00:24:38,759 --> 00:24:39,240
Here.

425
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,200
Thanks.

426
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,200
Did you play the disc I lent you yesterday?

427
00:24:44,519 --> 00:24:45,160
Not yet.

428
00:24:48,359 --> 00:24:50,680
Maybe the next time we meet,

429
00:24:50,839 --> 00:24:52,000
I should just give it back to you.

430
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,119
Okay.

431
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:57,559
I only just found out yesterday

432
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,440
that Zhao Yijie is your dad.

433
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:01,160
What about it?

434
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:04,079
I was just pretty shocked.

435
00:25:05,119 --> 00:25:05,920
Let me ask you something.

436
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:08,039
Is Zhao Yijie good to you?

437
00:25:08,519 --> 00:25:09,480
He's alright.

438
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:13,720
Has he ever hit you?

439
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:17,279
Why would he hit me?

440
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:21,400
I thought he and my dad

441
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,359
were exactly the same.

442
00:25:23,759 --> 00:25:24,599
What do you mean?

443
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:26,839
I mean,

444
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:28,680
he and Bi Wenhao

445
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:30,559
are both self-righteous control freaks.

446
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,000
He's not like that.

447
00:25:32,039 --> 00:25:33,240
Then what is he like?

448
00:25:33,279 --> 00:25:34,559
Zhao Yijie is really powerful.

449
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,279
He's not afraid of anything.

450
00:25:36,359 --> 00:25:37,519
He can fix any problem.

451
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,559
Powerful?

452
00:25:39,319 --> 00:25:39,880
No matter how powerful he is,

453
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:41,279
he's nothing but Bi Wenhao's lapdog.

454
00:25:41,279 --> 00:25:42,759
Don't you talk about Zhao Yijie like that!

455
00:25:46,799 --> 00:25:48,039
Bi Wenhao and him...

456
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:50,559
They act all respectable in public,

457
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:53,039
but show their true colors at home.

458
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:54,759
They only care about themselves.

459
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:57,160
They never care about us.

460
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,720
We're just toys.

461
00:25:58,880 --> 00:25:59,880
Punching bags.

462
00:26:00,519 --> 00:26:01,200
They never

463
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,640
treat us like individuals.

464
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,720
I hate them.

465
00:26:04,319 --> 00:26:06,279
I hate Bi Wenhao. I hate Zhao Yijie.

466
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:08,240
And your stupid grandpa, Yu Songfan!

467
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,240
My grandpa isn't stupid!

468
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,400
Why are you insulting him?

469
00:26:11,519 --> 00:26:13,119
No wonder Zhao Yijie keeps me from you.

470
00:26:14,160 --> 00:26:14,960
Awu!

471
00:26:15,519 --> 00:26:16,720
They're manipulating me,

472
00:26:17,119 --> 00:26:18,160
and they're manipulating you, too.

473
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:20,519
You'll understand someday.

474
00:26:28,319 --> 00:26:29,240
This part needs to be revised.

475
00:26:36,839 --> 00:26:38,880
These two need no introduction, I assume.

476
00:26:39,799 --> 00:26:41,920
We often deal with them on our cases.

477
00:26:58,319 --> 00:26:59,519
How did you find me here?

478
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,759
You weren't answering my calls.

479
00:27:02,279 --> 00:27:03,440
What happened to your voice?

480
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:05,079
And what happened to your hand?

481
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:07,599
About Lu Zhiyong's case...

482
00:27:07,599 --> 00:27:08,319
Don't mention him to me.

483
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:13,240
Team One's Major Crimes Unit handles it.

484
00:27:13,839 --> 00:27:14,720
It's not my case.

485
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:17,960
I'm only in charge of telecom fraud now.

486
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:18,920
Listen to me.

487
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:20,200
I don't want to.

488
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:21,680
It just makes me feel awful.

489
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,480
I used to be just like you.

490
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,640
I thought Ding's dad and them went too far.

491
00:27:26,079 --> 00:27:27,119
But now I know...

492
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,319
what made them

493
00:27:28,319 --> 00:27:29,279
go to such extremes.

494
00:27:29,279 --> 00:27:30,440
Listen to me.

495
00:27:30,759 --> 00:27:31,920
Lu Zhiyong is in great danger right now.

496
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:33,599
Bypass the detention center staff,

497
00:27:33,599 --> 00:27:35,240
and get your telecom fraud suspects,

498
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,599
especially the minors,

499
00:27:36,599 --> 00:27:38,039
to secretly protect Lu Zhiyong.

500
00:27:38,039 --> 00:27:39,079
Secretly protect him?

501
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:40,759
What do you mean?

502
00:27:46,759 --> 00:27:47,200
Don't ask.

503
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:49,279
One of them is in the same cell as Lu.

504
00:27:49,559 --> 00:27:50,359
You must find him,

505
00:27:50,839 --> 00:27:51,640
and ask for his help.

506
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:53,039
What exactly happened?

507
00:28:01,599 --> 00:28:03,400
Do not let your colleagues know.

508
00:28:03,839 --> 00:28:05,000
Don't breathe a word of this.

509
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:10,720
Please.

510
00:28:11,279 --> 00:28:12,000
Okay.

511
00:28:15,279 --> 00:28:15,920
Fan Dong.

512
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:24,880
That's all.

513
00:28:26,440 --> 00:28:27,119
You may go.

514
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:36,559
He came to see Fan Dong.

515
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:39,519
I heard from Warden Qi today.

516
00:28:39,519 --> 00:28:40,599
Lu Zhiyong wants to recant.

517
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:41,799
And he made a lot of demands.

518
00:28:42,119 --> 00:28:43,200
Xu Ruqing said

519
00:28:43,359 --> 00:28:44,799
she has sorted things out with Ding Ning.

520
00:28:45,359 --> 00:28:46,720
Do you need me to step in?

521
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:47,839
After all, delays breed trouble.

522
00:28:48,079 --> 00:28:48,759
No need.

523
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:50,799
Let's wait and see.

524
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,079
Let's see what Ding Ning does.

525
00:28:53,799 --> 00:28:54,160
Understood.

526
00:28:57,319 --> 00:29:01,000
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

527
00:29:01,119 --> 00:29:02,000
You have the nerve to show up here?!

528
00:29:03,119 --> 00:29:04,720
Your son killed my son!

529
00:29:04,920 --> 00:29:07,160
You still want a letter of forgiveness to cut his sentence?!

530
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,880
He should pay for my son's life with his own!

531
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:11,799
My son wasn't even thirty!

532
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:13,480
My boy!

533
00:29:13,519 --> 00:29:14,079
I'll kill you!

534
00:29:14,279 --> 00:29:15,119
I'm going to kill you!

535
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:17,319
I'm going to kill you, I'm telling you!

536
00:29:18,319 --> 00:29:19,599
I'm going to kill you!

537
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,640
Give me back my son's life!

538
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:22,759
I'll kill you!

539
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:26,119
Don't stop me!

540
00:29:26,119 --> 00:29:27,720
Give me back my son!

541
00:29:28,279 --> 00:29:29,440
Calm down, please calm down!

542
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,240
Calm down!

543
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:34,519
Give me back my son! Give me back my son!

544
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,160
Alright, alright. We're sorry!

545
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:38,079
Nothing to see here.

546
00:29:38,079 --> 00:29:38,759
Go home, just go home!

547
00:29:38,759 --> 00:29:39,559
Nothing to see here!

548
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:42,680
I beg you, please forgive my son!

549
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:45,960
Hit me or curse me,

550
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:47,559
do whatever you want!

551
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:50,880
I'm sorry!

552
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:52,240
It's okay now. It's okay.

553
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,160
I'm sorry!

554
00:30:00,759 --> 00:30:01,559
Just sit down for a moment.

555
00:30:17,039 --> 00:30:17,880
Let them.

556
00:30:18,759 --> 00:30:19,680
They can hit me or yell at me.

557
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:23,519
If they sign the letter of forgiveness,

558
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,920
I can take anything.

559
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:33,839
I went to see Old Kong.

560
00:30:35,039 --> 00:30:36,079
I wanted to give the money

561
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,880
back to him.

562
00:30:38,799 --> 00:30:40,240
I don't want the house anymore.

563
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:42,279
I don't want anything anymore.

564
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,599
I just want my son.

565
00:30:44,839 --> 00:30:46,200
I was wrong.

566
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:47,400
What did Old Kong say?

567
00:30:48,519 --> 00:30:49,160
He said

568
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:52,400
my son really did stab someone.

569
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,680
He also said...

570
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,680
Did he also say

571
00:30:57,279 --> 00:30:59,079
that if Xiao Lu recants now,

572
00:31:00,079 --> 00:31:01,319
you'll lose both him and the money,

573
00:31:02,039 --> 00:31:03,839
and won't be able to pay civil compensation?

574
00:31:11,279 --> 00:31:13,240
His father is already gone.

575
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:17,480
I can't lose my son too.

576
00:31:18,119 --> 00:31:22,039
Xiaoyong... Xiaoyong is such a good boy.

577
00:31:22,119 --> 00:31:23,079
It's all my fault.

578
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:25,480
Is there really no turning back for us?

579
00:31:25,839 --> 00:31:26,720
It's okay.

580
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:32,440
My Xiaoyong.

581
00:31:33,319 --> 00:31:35,359
I failed him.

582
00:32:07,599 --> 00:32:08,799
Xiao Lu, time to get up.

583
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,000
Xiao Lu!

584
00:32:10,599 --> 00:32:11,680
Wake up!

585
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:15,680
Xiao Lu!

586
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:16,599
Xiao Lu!

587
00:32:16,839 --> 00:32:17,880
Help!

588
00:32:18,039 --> 00:32:19,759
Someone is dead! Somebody help!

589
00:32:23,079 --> 00:32:25,079
The air at our nursing home is very fresh.

590
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:26,799
We also have a spacious garden.

591
00:32:27,079 --> 00:32:28,599
We offer both single and double rooms.

592
00:32:29,039 --> 00:32:29,880
Come with me, I'll show you around some more.

593
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:30,759
Okay, we'll talk later.

594
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,680
Jiangliu City Deputy Mayor Bi Wenhao

595
00:32:32,680 --> 00:32:35,559
emphasized during flood relief efforts...

596
00:32:40,839 --> 00:32:41,960
Why?

597
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:43,240
Listen to me...

598
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,799
Why did you do this to him?

599
00:32:45,079 --> 00:32:47,160
Why did you kill Xiao Lu? Tell me!

600
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,240
Ding Ning, calm down!

601
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:51,319
Come here. Come here.

602
00:32:52,519 --> 00:32:52,759
You...

603
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:54,079
Listen to me, Ding Ning.

604
00:32:54,079 --> 00:32:55,799
Is this what you wanted to turn me into?

605
00:32:55,799 --> 00:32:56,440
Listen to me first.

606
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:57,400
Are you satisfied?

607
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:58,279
Are you satisfied yet?!

608
00:32:58,279 --> 00:32:58,799
Okay.

609
00:32:58,799 --> 00:32:59,480
Are you satisfied yet?!

610
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,200
Enough. Enough!

611
00:33:01,839 --> 00:33:02,480
That's enough!

612
00:33:07,559 --> 00:33:09,039
Want to check the autopsy report first?

613
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:15,400
I've read it.

614
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,799
I know it was myocarditis.

615
00:33:44,559 --> 00:33:45,200
So you know now,

616
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:46,799
it wasn't Mr. Bi and his men who did it.

617
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:49,079
But they thought

618
00:33:49,079 --> 00:33:50,440
Xiao Lu was going to recant.

619
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,559
You were meeting his demands,

620
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,880
while getting Fan Dong to completely...

621
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,920
completely take care of Xiao Lu.

622
00:34:01,599 --> 00:34:02,440
I went to Fan Dong

623
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:03,920
to protect Xiao Lu.

624
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,680
I know.

625
00:34:05,799 --> 00:34:07,519
But they didn't see it that way.

626
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,280
They were very pleased.

627
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,639
So this accident worked in your favor.

628
00:34:12,679 --> 00:34:14,280
I don't care what they think.

629
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:16,079
Lu Zhiyong was only thirteen.

630
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:18,039
His life hadn't even begun

631
00:34:18,039 --> 00:34:19,360
and it was already over.

632
00:34:19,599 --> 00:34:20,400
It's all your fault.

633
00:34:21,239 --> 00:34:22,559
It's all because of you.

634
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:24,400
He wouldn't be in detention without you.

635
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:25,480
He wouldn't have gotten myocarditis.

636
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,719
He wouldn't have died.

637
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,320
Yes.

638
00:34:34,559 --> 00:34:35,239
It's all because of me.

639
00:34:46,719 --> 00:34:47,320
Ding Ning,

640
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:50,079
you didn't do anything wrong.

641
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,480
Just to let Xiao Lu offer incense to his dad,

642
00:34:56,960 --> 00:34:59,000
look at what you've done to yourself.

643
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:05,719
You noticed Xiao Lu was sick in prison

644
00:35:05,719 --> 00:35:06,840
and urged him to see a doctor.

645
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:08,639
He was the one who chose not to go.

646
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,679
You knew he was going to recant.

647
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:12,920
You were afraid he'd have an accident,

648
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,599
so you even asked Fan Dong for help, right?

649
00:35:17,239 --> 00:35:19,079
You've already done everything you could

650
00:35:19,079 --> 00:35:20,360
to help him.

651
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:29,119
I got another kid killed.

652
00:35:30,599 --> 00:35:31,840
Once again.

653
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:44,159
I'm the one who got him killed.

654
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:47,920
I'm the one who made him take the fall.

655
00:35:49,599 --> 00:35:50,920
It's exactly because of this kid

656
00:35:51,239 --> 00:35:52,519
that I saw Bi Wenhao for who he really is,

657
00:35:52,920 --> 00:35:54,360
and wanted to cut ties with them.

658
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:57,320
Let me finish putting on this act.

659
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,480
So you were right to come to me today.

660
00:36:04,199 --> 00:36:05,840
You were right to beat me up like this.

661
00:36:07,079 --> 00:36:08,840
You're right to hate me.

662
00:36:14,679 --> 00:36:16,320
But blaming yourself

663
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,199
is wrong.

664
00:36:21,079 --> 00:36:21,840
There's no need.

665
00:36:27,159 --> 00:36:28,239
That evidence...

666
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,840
That dashcam...

667
00:36:33,440 --> 00:36:37,079
Who you gave the dashcam to didn't matter.

668
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:39,920
I handed it to you myself.

669
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:42,920
Xiao Lu killed someone.

670
00:36:45,559 --> 00:36:47,159
He killed someone.

671
00:37:08,599 --> 00:37:09,320
Let's go.

672
00:37:26,519 --> 00:37:27,880
Someone's coming.

673
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,400
Why are you so bad?

674
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,480
Can't you use your brain?

675
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:49,760
Didn't you see him coming?

676
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,039
Quick, stick with me.

677
00:37:52,679 --> 00:37:54,199
Look at you, you died again.

678
00:37:54,199 --> 00:37:55,480
You're always the first to die.

679
00:37:56,719 --> 00:37:57,719
What are you yelling about?

680
00:37:57,960 --> 00:37:58,599
Geez.

681
00:37:58,679 --> 00:37:59,880
Your dad is working in the study.

682
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:01,280
If he hears you, he'll scold you again.

683
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:02,480
Stop playing.

684
00:38:03,199 --> 00:38:04,559
You're so oblivious all the time.

685
00:38:04,559 --> 00:38:05,760
You either play games or run outside.

686
00:38:06,519 --> 00:38:06,840
Go.

687
00:38:07,519 --> 00:38:08,719
Bring a cup of tea to your dad.

688
00:38:09,960 --> 00:38:10,719
Hurry up.

689
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,519
Hurry up and go.

690
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:31,880
How's the place I found for Old Yu?

691
00:38:38,840 --> 00:38:39,639
Let me take this call.

692
00:38:40,639 --> 00:38:42,000
Why don't you look around?

693
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:51,480
Hello.

694
00:38:51,519 --> 00:38:52,320
Yijie.

695
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:53,440
What's the situation now?

696
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:54,880
Here's the situation.

697
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,360
Xiao Lu is dead.

698
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:57,760
So the trial has been terminated.

699
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,800
No one should look into this anymore.

700
00:39:01,199 --> 00:39:02,079
As for this matter,

701
00:39:02,159 --> 00:39:03,239
Ding Ning handled it well.

702
00:39:04,519 --> 00:39:07,119
Looks like she finally chose a side.

703
00:39:08,559 --> 00:39:09,559
Get the welcome dinner ready.

704
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:10,559
Yijie.

705
00:39:21,519 --> 00:39:23,039
Lu Zhiyong is dead now.

706
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,440
And we have all the evidence.

707
00:39:25,960 --> 00:39:27,719
We can finally put this behind us.

708
00:39:28,960 --> 00:39:29,480
Yijie.

709
00:39:30,119 --> 00:39:31,000
Thank you.

710
00:40:07,079 --> 00:40:07,719
Hello.

711
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,719
Do you remember me?

712
00:40:22,199 --> 00:40:23,280
A year and a half ago,

713
00:40:25,079 --> 00:40:26,400
none of us could have imagined

714
00:40:28,480 --> 00:40:30,239
that the judge who heard your case

715
00:40:31,519 --> 00:40:33,840
might end up in the same nursing home.

716
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,360
Mr. Bi said

717
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,360
he's hosting a banquet for you tonight.

718
00:41:09,440 --> 00:41:10,519
Everyone will be there.

719
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,079
I'll go with you.

720
00:41:18,119 --> 00:41:19,280
Get yourself ready then.

721
00:41:19,679 --> 00:41:20,760
I have some errands to run first.

722
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:22,800
We'll meet up later.

723
00:41:27,599 --> 00:41:30,199
Truth and lies, right and wrong, good and evil...

724
00:41:31,079 --> 00:41:32,119
Maybe it's like you said,

725
00:41:33,320 --> 00:41:34,280
they aren't that important

726
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:37,760
because there's no absolute standard.

727
00:41:38,599 --> 00:41:39,719
But I care about them.

728
00:41:40,679 --> 00:41:41,960
I will do whatever it takes

729
00:41:43,559 --> 00:41:44,400
to find deep within my heart

730
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:46,320
the answers that belong to them.

731
00:41:51,519 --> 00:41:52,199
Actually,

732
00:41:52,559 --> 00:41:54,440
it means she's trying to hint to us

733
00:41:55,039 --> 00:41:55,920
that she wants to join.

734
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:58,000
All the evidence is in our hands now.

735
00:41:58,239 --> 00:41:59,800
Now that Lu Zhiyong is dead,

736
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:01,960
we can finally breathe easy.

737
00:42:03,079 --> 00:42:03,599
Yijie.

738
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:04,599
Thank you.

739
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:11,119
Only after meeting him did I realize

740
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:14,159
how brave he is,

741
00:42:15,719 --> 00:42:17,840
and how cowardly I am.

742
00:42:20,119 --> 00:42:22,440
I finally understood that my past life

743
00:42:23,599 --> 00:42:24,760
was so selfish

744
00:42:26,119 --> 00:42:27,280
and so absurd.

745
00:42:30,239 --> 00:42:32,159
I want him to never be submissive again,

746
00:42:32,440 --> 00:42:33,239
or take orders from others.

747
00:42:34,119 --> 00:42:35,199
I want him to be able to do anything

748
00:42:35,199 --> 00:42:36,880
he truly wants to do.

749
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:42,559
Waiting for him to come back

750
00:42:43,320 --> 00:42:44,519
is now the only hope

751
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,400
I have left in my life.

752
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:07,719
A three-month shelf life.

753
00:43:07,719 --> 00:43:08,679
How am I supposed to finish all this?

754
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:13,079
Thank you so much, Lawyer Chang.

755
00:43:13,079 --> 00:43:14,719
We dried these salted fish ourselves.

756
00:43:14,719 --> 00:43:15,599
Please take them and enjoy.

757
00:43:15,599 --> 00:43:16,800
You're really too kind.

758
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:17,599
Thank you. Thank you.

759
00:43:17,639 --> 00:43:19,320
My relatives grew these vegetables.

760
00:43:19,320 --> 00:43:20,159
And some Chinese yam.

761
00:43:20,159 --> 00:43:20,719
Use it to make soup.

762
00:43:20,719 --> 00:43:21,360
Take care of your health.

763
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:22,000
Thank you.

764
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:22,880
You've worked so hard.

765
00:43:23,079 --> 00:43:23,920
You really have.

766
00:43:27,159 --> 00:43:28,440
Mentor, I'll leave the files here.

767
00:43:28,480 --> 00:43:29,960
Xiao Luo, do you have hemorrhoids?

768
00:43:30,079 --> 00:43:31,159
Mentor, how did you know?

769
00:43:31,440 --> 00:43:32,119
Take this.

770
00:43:32,400 --> 00:43:33,599
I... I won't need this much.

771
00:43:33,599 --> 00:43:34,480
Ask around.

772
00:43:35,599 --> 00:43:36,199
Okay.

773
00:43:36,199 --> 00:43:36,840
Two boxes of eggs.

774
00:43:37,159 --> 00:43:37,599
Divide them up.

775
00:43:37,599 --> 00:43:38,079
While they're still fresh.

776
00:43:38,079 --> 00:43:38,679
Okay.

777
00:43:39,719 --> 00:43:40,760
Band-Aids.

778
00:43:41,599 --> 00:43:43,039
For bruises and sprains.

779
00:43:44,239 --> 00:43:45,280
Iodine.

780
00:43:45,679 --> 00:43:47,519
Can't anyone wish me well?

781
00:43:55,480 --> 00:43:56,440
Zhao Yijie.
